# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock

# Mnemo data files
*.mnemo.db
*.mnemo.db.wal
.mnemo/
# ...except checked-in golden fixtures used by migration round-trip tests.
!crates/mnemo-core/tests/golden/*.mnemo.db

# USearch index files
*.usearch
*.mappings.json

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/
*.whl

# Node.js
**/node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Environment
.env
.env.*

# IDEs
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Claude Code auto-memory
.claude/auto-memory/dirty-files

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.gstack/

# Playwright MCP scratch (snapshots, console logs)
.playwright-mcp/

# mnemo-golem-wit is an excluded, self-rooted workspace (see root Cargo.toml);
# its standalone `cargo component build` writes here.
/crates/mnemo-golem-wit/target/

# mdBook build output (docs/book.toml sets build-dir = "book"); built in CI and
# deployed to Pages, never committed.
/docs/book/

# Private working docs — strategy/ROI analysis and the kill-criteria for the
# mnemo bet. Both are marked PRIVATE in their own headers and have sat untracked
# but UNIGNORED in a public repo, one `git add -A` away from being published.
# Ignore them so that cannot happen by accident.
/MNEMO_STRATEGY_PRIVATE.md
/KILL_CRITERIA.md
